#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let us study how we color the coupling map of a backend.  This is needed to "
"group $ZZ$ interactions into layers.\n"
msgstr ""
"Veamos cómo colorear el mapa de acoplamiento de un backend. Esto es "
