#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5. Solve the 127-qubit version of the problem {#5-solve-the-127-qubit-"
"version-of-the-problem}"
msgstr ""
"5. Resolver la versión de 127 qubits del problema {#5-solve-the-127-qubit-"
"version-of-the-problem}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is your goal to run the utility-scale experiment as mentioned at the "
"beginning. You will create and execute a 127-qubit and 60-layer (20 Trotter "
"steps) circuit with  $\\langle Z_{62} \\rangle$ as an observable. We "
"recommend you try to do this yourself, using the code for the 27-qubit "
"version when appropriate. But the solution is provided here.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tu objetivo es realizar el experimento a escala de utilidad como se "
"describió al principio. Crearás y ejecutarás un circuito de 127 qubits "
"$\\times$ 60 capas (20 pasos de Trotter) con $\\langle Z_{62} \\rangle$ como"
" observable. Te recomendamos que lo intentes por tu cuenta usando el código "
"de la versión de 27 qubits como plantilla. Sin embargo, la solución se "
"proporciona aquí.\n"

